# Suppressed from the CI scan gate. Each entry needs a reason - keep these in
# sync with .grype.yaml.

# Tesseract, no fix available upstream (5.5.3 is the latest tag and is also
# affected). Both need Tesseract to load an attacker-crafted .traineddata, and
# ocr.py/ocr_api.py never let request input choose a model path.
CVE-2026-88047
CVE-2026-88048

# CVE-2026-88051/88052/88053 are absent because they are fixed, not suppressed:
# the image builds tesseract from source with the upstream fixes backported.
# See patches/README.md.

# zlib CVE-2026-85091: heap overflow reachable only via the gzFile API
# (gzprintf/gzvprintf), which nothing in this image calls. Fixed upstream but
# unreleased. Left unsuppressed by an explicit decision - uncomment to suppress.
# CVE-2026-85091
